    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to present 16 Beaufort Abbey a large four bedroom duplex apartment in a much desired estate. The duplex has its own front door, is situated within a private gated development, and is well positioned towards the front of the estate.\r\n\r\nThe property is well located within walking distance of excellent amenities including a creche, Navan Shopping Centre, schools and Blackwater Park. Beaufort Abbey is on the northside of Navan, and benefit's from a new link road connecting the north side of Navan to the N51 which therefore the apartment's easily accessible to the M3 Motorway and is within walking distance to all bus routes to Dublin.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is in excellent condition and comprises of an entrance foyer on the ground floor, the first floor consists of  an open plan kitchen / dining room, main bathroom, double bedroom and a living room with access to a balcony. The second floor comprises of a second bathroom, two spacious bedrooms and a master ensuite bedroom. The apartment includes two designated parking spaces, with plenty of guest parking within the scheme."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Four bedroom duplex apartment\r\nDesignated parking space\r\nSituated within a secure gated scheme\r\nLocated within walking distance of Navan town centre\r\nConvenient access to the M3"
      },
